{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138720/extras/T1_ENG.gif?t=1744303702\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138720/extras/txt1_ENG.png?t=1744303702\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138720/extras/T2_titleENG2.gif?t=1744303702\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138720/extras/txt2_ENG.png?t=1744303702\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138720/extras/T3_titleENG2.gif?t=1744303702\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138720/extras/txt3_ENG.png?t=1744303702\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2138720?t=1744303702","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744303702","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138720/d3ee28c2fa9929d49b59430f56dfa75a501c1cee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744303702","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138720/d3ee28c2fa9929d49b59430f56dfa75a501c1cee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744303702","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pre-purchase the <strong>Rematch Pro</strong> or <strong>Elite Edition</strong> now and lock in your place on the pitch where the action never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exclusive Pre-purchase Bonuses:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>72h Early Access:</strong> Be first on the field, available with both Pro and Elite Editions. <br>- <strong>&quot;Adopter&quot; Hat:</strong> To thank you for your support and belief in us from the start, a nod to our community, available across all editions.</p></p><br><h1>Elite Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138720/extras/ELITE_FullPack-Preorder.png?t=1744303702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rule the game with the <strong>Rematch Elite Edition</strong>, where excellence meets exclusivity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2 x Captain Pass Upgrade Ticket</strong> \u2013 Double the rewards,  double the swag.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blazon Player Background &amp; Title</strong> \u2013 Showcase your identity with an epic design that makes a statement as unique as you are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blazon Buckler Tank Top</strong> \u2013  Classic tank top rebellion with blazon elegance, crafted for those who show their strength and shape their destiny with every match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blazon Pattern (for Top &amp; Bottom clothes)</strong> \u2013  Infuse your outfit with a seamless epic design that truly reflects your unique identity\u2014perfect for those who want their style to tell their story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blazon Jewel Set</strong>  \u2013 Crafted from folded leather, each piece designed to shine on and off the field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Glitcher Trainers</strong> \u2013 Step into the future with every stride. Who says errors can't be aesthetic?  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blazon Augmented Reality Cage</strong>  \u2013 Brings each match to life with a vibrant blazon display that celebrates every goal. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blazon Cap</strong> \u2013 It's more than just a cap\u2014it's a declaration of status, identity, and conviction.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Pro Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138720/extras/PRO_FullPack-Preorder.png?t=1744303702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step onto the pitch with the <strong>Rematch Pro Edition</strong>, designed for the dedicated. It includes:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Captain Pass Upgrade Ticket</strong> \u2013 Elevate your game and your rewards, step by step. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blazon Player Background &amp; Title</strong> \u2013 Showcase your identity with an epic design that makes a statement as unique as you are. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blazon Buckler Tank Top</strong> \u2013  Classic tank top rebellion with blazon elegance, crafted for those who show their strength and shape their destiny with every match. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blazon Pattern (for Top &amp; Bottom clothes)</strong> \u2013  Infuse your outfit with a seamless epic design that truly reflects your unique identity\u2014perfect for those who want their style to tell their story. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blazon Jewel Set</strong>  \u2013 Crafted from folded leather, each piece designed to shine on and off the field.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138720/extras/T1_ENG.gif?t=1744303702\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2138720/extras/txt1_ENG.png?t=